Subject: [PATCH 07245/11362] [outer-loop] REQ-ARC-WMTE-5717: Phase 3 dev-gated
 playbook-exemplar stall injection + spec

Adds an opt-in include_playbook_exemplars flag to induce_prompt (default False ->
byte-identical) and to LocalGGUFProposer/CodexProposer, and wires E3AgentPolicy to
arm it ONLY on the stall/first-contact re-induction path, gated by
SUBMITTED_PLAYBOOK_EXEMPLARS_ENABLED (default False) OR
CARNOT_ARC_PLAYBOOK_EXEMPLARS_ENABLED. Injects a small game-agnostic exploration-
method few-shot into the tier-3 induction prompt without long reasoning. Frozen
scored-submission default unchanged; submission_kernel untouched.

Adds experiment_5717 (matched-budget offline A/B, live Qwen3.5-9B-MTP), 10 unit
tests (mechanism, off-by-default, stall gate), and REQ/SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-5716/5717
in the arc-human-replay-frame-change spec. ruff+mypy clean.

